This directory contains legacy build resources specific to the macOS
platform.  The related sh/make_pkg.sh and sh/make_dmg.sh scripts predate
Apple's current flat-package, signing, and notarization workflows.  They
remain as behavioral references while native PKG and DMG backends are
prepared in misc/tools/brlinst.  They are not connected to current CMake
package targets.


README
	this file

Resources/
	contains the legacy files for an Installer .pkg including the
	ReadMe, Welcome, License, and any installation support
	scripts.

background.png
	the background image for the .dmg installation images.

openUp.c
	a .dmg helper program used by sh/make_dmg.sh to force the
	disk mounting image to automatically open up a window when it
	is mounted.
